,90,23],[11593,53.4,2006,66,88,19]],"links":[["Marion County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/florida/marion-county"],["ARC or PLC in Marion County","/arc-plc/florida/marion-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Marion County record runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 that same pair came in at 25% of normal on the middle of the grids, and March to April 2026 came in at 40%. Grid 10992 had its driest year in 2000, at 60% of normal.</p>"}
